# TLA+ Toolbox and TLC-generated state/trace artifacts
**/.toolbox/
**/states/
**/states-*/
**/MC*.tla
**/*_TTrace_*.tla
**/*.out

# Locally generated model-check reports; retain the versioned schema.
formal/results/*.json
!formal/results/schema.json
!formal/results/h1-full.result.json

# Retain the current H1 Verus evidence and its versioned schema.
mechanized/results/*.json
!mechanized/results/verification-report.json
!mechanized/results/verification-report.schema.v1.json
